        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "SECTION 6.6. A night premium of eighty-five cents ($0.85) per hour will be paid for regularly scheduled hours worked between the hours of 9 p.m. and 6 a.m. (Does not apply to overtime hours worked.)",
