        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "SECTION 6.7. Wage rate progression in each separate classification shall be based on progression interval in each classification. Notwithstanding, any employee, who transfers to a higher rated classification, shall have their hourly rate changed pursuant to \"Wage Schedule Administration Exhibit A\" attached hereto. Such employee will serve a probationary period not to exceed 180 calendar days. At the end of that time the employee shall be assigned the higher classification or be transferred back to their previous classification. In no case shall the hourly rate of pay of an employee who is transferred to a higher job classification be decreased, except for reasons of being transferred back to their previous classification in accordance with this Section 6.7.",
